### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 3, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-16-23 for a City Network Operations Core Layer 3 Switch
Replacement
 ______________________________________________
Bid #E-16-23 was solicited for a City Network Operations Core Layer 3 Switch Replacement for
the City of Cheyenne Information Technology Division.

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1.
Sunflower Lab LLC.  Hilliard, OH.
2.
High Country Workplace Technologies.  Arvada, CO.

The bids were reviewed by Tyler Nelson (Information Technology), and Dustin Swalla
(Information Technology), and thier recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from
High Country Workplace Technologies.

The total Bid Award amount is $70,777.39.

Funding:
020-26-2615-40-43102 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Equipment)
```

